---
// About: short and calm (mockup B pacing). Under 150 words. The founder's own text (supplied 21 Nov 2026);
// nothing here is invented. No phone number or ID numbers. `npm run check:brackets` lists any placeholder left.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Durbeen: an independent lab run by an I&C engineer | Durbeen"
  description="Durbeen, which means telescope, is an independent lab run by Fahad Ehsan, an I&C engineer who tests AI on real work and writes down what breaks."
>
  <article class="container page">
    <p class="label">ABOUT</p>
    <h1>Look further. Look closer. Then build.</h1>

    <div class="text">
      <p>Durbeen is an independent lab run by an instrumentation &amp; controls engineer testing AI on real work. The name means telescope.</p>
      <p>
        I'm Fahad Ehsan, an Instrumentation &amp; Controls engineer with 18+ years in Oil &amp; Gas and water projects
        across the GCC: DCS commissioning, FAT/SAT, inspection and OT/ICS cybersecurity. I started Durbeen to learn AI the
        way engineers learn anything: by testing it on real work.
      </p>
      <p>
        Here I share what I build, what works, what doesn't, and how AI can help engineers with reports, documents and
        everyday workflows. I'm a learner, not a guru. Every tool I write about, I've actually used. If something here saves
        you an hour, it was worth publishing.
      </p>
      <p>Current work is on the <a href="/projects/">Projects</a> page. To get in touch: <span class="mail">hello@durbeen.io</span></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-block: clamp(64px, 9vw, 140px) var(--space-section);
  }
  .label {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }
  h1 {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px);
    font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 104px);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .text {
    max-width: 620px;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .text p {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
  }
  .mail {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--ink);
    user-select: all;
  }
</style>
